{{ ref: 95eabafe-b001-4b52-95a1-1df81b2e7347 }}
- **Scope**: The complete `cli` crate (all five commands plus rendering), the default `strata.toml`, end-to-end fixture repos for all three languages, and the library/CLI parity test.
--{ ref: 95eabafe-b001-4b52-95a1-1df81b2e7347 }--
{{ ref: bd0b1872-639d-4143-91ee-d4a71ca58c1f }}
- **Description**: A thin shell over the engine — the CLI parses flags, calls the same public library functions any embedder would, and renders. Exit codes: 0 success, 1 mapped from `StrataError`, 2 reserved exclusively for `violations --fail-on` matches; borderline findings (±10% of a cap) never gate CI. The parity test pins the AD-5 guarantee: `--format json` output is byte-identical to the serialized library result.
--{ ref: bd0b1872-639d-4143-91ee-d4a71ca58c1f }--

